        <STIG_DATA>
          <VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Check_Content</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
          <ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Verify the "sshd.service" is enabled and active with the following commands: 
 
$ sudo systemctl is-enabled ssh
enabled

$ sudo systemctl is-active ssh
active

If "ssh.service" is not active or loaded, this is a finding.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
        </STIG_DATA>
