          <VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Fix_Text</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
          <ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Enable the "ssh" service to start automatically on reboot with the following command: 
 
$ sudo systemctl enable ssh.service 
 
ensure the "ssh" service is running 
 
$ sudo systemctl start ssh.service</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
