        </STIG_DATA>
        <STIG_DATA>
          <VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Check_Content</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
          <ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Verify that Ubuntu 24.04 LTS configures the /var/log/syslog file to be owned by "syslog" with the following command: 
 
$ stat -c "%n %U" /var/log/syslog 
/var/log/syslog syslog 
 
If the "/var/log/syslog" file is not owned by syslog, this is a finding.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
