/sbin/autrace root 
/sbin/auditd root 
/sbin/audispd root 
/sbin/augenrules root 
 
If any of the audit tools are not group-owned by root, this is a finding.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
        </STIG_DATA>
        <STIG_DATA>
          <VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Check_Content_Ref</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
          <ATTRIBUTE_DATA>C-74856r1066956_chk</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
