        <STIG_DATA>
          <VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Fix_Text</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
          <ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Configure the audit tools on Ubuntu 24.04 LTS to be protected from unauthorized access by setting the file group as  root using the following command: 
 
$ sudo chown :root [audit_tool] 
 
Replace "[audit_tool]" with each audit tool not group-owned by root.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
